<view class="page">
  <text class="eyebrow">M3 · 免费组队</text>
  <view class="hero">校园同行</view>
  <view class="card">
    <text class="label">固定路线</text>
    <picker range="{{routeLabels}}" value="{{routeIndex}}" bindchange="onRouteChange">
      <view class="picker">{{routeLabels[routeIndex] || '暂无路线'}}</view>
    </picker>
    <text class="label">30 分钟时间窗</text>
    <picker range="{{windowLabels}}" value="{{windowIndex}}" bindchange="onWindowChange">
      <view class="picker">{{windowLabels[windowIndex] || '暂无时间窗'}}</view>
    </picker>
    <text class="muted">{{message}}</text>
  </view>
  <view class="card group" wx:for="{{groups}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openGroup">
    <view class="row"><text class="strong">{{item.occupiedSeats}} / 4 座</text><text>{{item.state}}</text></view>
    <text class="muted">{{item.accountCount}} 个认证账号 · 剩余 {{item.remainingSeats}} 座</text>
  </view>
  <view class="card warning">
    <text>平台只撮合同路学生。学生自行通过正规平台叫车；平台不提供司机、车辆、运价、车费结算或运输服务。</text>
  </view>
</view>
